Imports:
  - Types:
      - Source
    From: source-api/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/source

Annotations: |
  This cell is the runtime registry of every currently-loaded Source: it is how the rest of
  the app turns a numeric source id into a live Source instance, without knowing whether that
  source is LocalSource or a loaded extension.

  Use Source from Imports throughout.

---

"SourceManager()":
  location: SourceManager.kt
  annotations: |
    Central registry mapping source ids to live Source instances.
  properties:
    "isInitialized -> StateFlow<Boolean>": |
      Whether the initial source-loading pass (local source plus every installed extension) has
      completed.
    "sources -> Flow<List<Source>>": |
      Reactive stream of every currently-loaded source, updated as extensions are
      installed/uninstalled/enabled/disabled.
  methods:
    "get(sourceKey: Long) -> source:Source?": |
      The loaded source with id `sourceKey`, or null if none is loaded under that id.
    "getOrStub(sourceKey: Long) -> source:Source": |
      Like get, but never returns null: falls back to a placeholder "stub" source (carrying
      only the id) for a manga whose real source is not currently installed, so the manga can
      still be displayed.
    "getAll() -> sources:List<Source>": |
      Every currently-loaded source.
    "getOnlineSources() -> sources:List<HttpSource>": |
      Every currently-loaded source that is network-backed (excludes the local source).
    "getStubSources() -> sources:List<StubSource>": |
      Placeholder entries for sources referenced by library manga but not currently installed.

---

Author: Goga
CreatedAt: 26/08/26
Description: |
  Registry/lookup service for live Source instances. HttpSource (a CatalogueSource
  specialization for network-backed sources) and StubSource (the not-installed placeholder) are
  sibling types not documented in this forest; both are used here only as return-type shapes,
  not as contractual obligations of this cell.
